WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.770
- We're throwing a pasta party!

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:03.560
I would just call it yay.

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.490
Oh God. I could eat baked ziti every day.

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:08.510
- Girl, you got the power.

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:11.410
Have either one of you been glamboozled?

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.768
Or have you been the glamboozler?

00:00:13.768 --> 00:00:17.950
- People are getting busy
and being real loud about it.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.070
Is there someone here who
doesn't like Robert Pattinson?

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:23.020
I am not George Costanza

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:25.210
who wants to eat a Turkey sandwich

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.453
and do it, if you know what I mean.

00:00:28.738 --> 00:00:31.405
(Drew laughing)

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:35.560
Oh God, no.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:36.470
Oh my God.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:37.430
Gosh darn you.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.490
Oh!
- Bring it on.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:41.050
- Oh no!

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:41.883
Oh no, no.

00:00:41.883 --> 00:00:42.716
No!

00:00:42.716 --> 00:00:43.549
(Drew yelling)

00:00:43.549 --> 00:00:44.662
- Oh my God, shut up!

00:00:44.662 --> 00:00:46.258
- Hi baby!

00:00:46.258 --> 00:00:48.262
(Drew slurping)

00:00:48.262 --> 00:00:50.185
(Drew hissing)
- [Ross] Yeah.

00:00:50.185 --> 00:00:51.184
- I'm eating!

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:52.017
Feel that, Rossy.

00:00:52.017 --> 00:00:53.000
- Look it, look it, let me see.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:53.833
Hey!

00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:57.527
- Wow, she got guns.
- Wow.

00:00:57.527 --> 00:00:59.716
(all laughing)

